{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\WINDOWS\\\\System32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\powershell.exe\" -Command '$lines=Get-Content -LiteralPath '\"'kibitz-runs\\\\2026-07-12-dynamic-story-visual\\\\r4\\\\input.md'; for(\"'$n=1200;$n -lt $lines.Count;$n++){ '\"'{0,5}: {1}' -f (\"'$n+1),$lines[$n] }'","aggregated_output":" 1201: the operator-triggered fan-out (Lesson 9).\r\n 1202: \r\n 1203: ### 9.4 Sprint receipt (fill at close)\r\n 1204: \r\n 1205: ```text\r\n 1206: SPRINT RECEIPT: PASS | FAIL\r\n 1207: scope:                    dynamic_story visual direction (vd-1)\r\n 1208: authoritative_writers:    OTR_DynamicStoryDirection -> meta.visual_direction\r\n 1209: durable_artifacts:        meta.visual_direction (+ semantic/artifact seals);\r\n 1210:                           visual_direction_semantic_sha256 + composed prompt on image rows\r\n 1211:                           and video creative sidecars (dynamic lane only)\r\n 1212: canonical_workflow_hash:  <after the node 96 / link 284 delta>\r\n 1213: focused_tests:            <9.1 items 1-21>\r\n 1214: full_suite:               <passed/skipped/xfail>\r\n 1215: bug_bible:                <result>\r\n 1216: model_pairings:           mistral-nemo | gemma-4-E4B | <declared cloud creative lane>\r\n 1217: 30_word_receipts:         <ledger + asset paths per pairing>\r\n 1218: 120_word_receipts:        <ledger + asset paths per pairing>\r\n 1219: 720_word_receipts:        <only after 120w is green>\r\n 1220: live_ledgers:             <paths>\r\n 1221: published_assets:         <otr\\obs\\ paths, Test-Path verified>\r\n 1222: prod_bug_entries:         <PBUG ids, or none>\r\n 1223: head:                     <sha>\r\n 1224: origin:                   <sha -- must equal head>\r\n 1225: remaining_risks:\r\n 1226: ```\r\n 1227: \r\n 1228: ---\r\n 1229: \r\n 1230: ## 10. Remaining decisions for Codex\r\n 1231: \r\n 1232: CLOSED by r1: sentinel = code-side, no placeholder pack (D1); no reroll in v1 (D4);\r\n 1233: wardrobe orthogonal (D7); per-shot notes artifact-side with mandatory consumption (D3);\r\n 1234: talking lane pinned to the safety base (D6).\r\n 1235: \r\n 1236: CLOSED by r2: **D2** = `creative` slot (fable2 precedent, 4.2). **D5** = still_word\r\n 1237: typography/backdrop pinned to the safety base in v1 (2.4). **D8** = the budget equation\r\n 1238: + the P-A/P-B split (4.4). **D9** = Python constant module (8.6). **D10** = an\r\n 1239: `is_dynamic` flag on the resolved `VisualStyle` (5.4).\r\n 1240: \r\n 1241: CLOSED by r3: the workflow delta (node 96 / link 284, repoint-don't-renumber, 8.3);\r\n 1242: `gate_in` cut from the node; no `max_length` on authored strings (2.1); the per-kind\r\n 1243: consumption matrix (7.4); `content_mutations` cut (2.3).\r\n 1244: \r\n 1245: **I4 -- the direction/audio ordering edge. JUDGE'S RULING: NOT in v1.** The r3 panel\r\n 1246: proposed a `96.done -> 81.gate_in` edge (link 285) to force the direction pass ahead of\r\n 1247: the audio lane. Rejected for v1 on evidence the panel did not weigh: ComfyUI executes\r\n 1248: nodes SERIALLY, the direction node unloads its LLM in `finally`, and the LLM-after-audio\r\n 1249: pattern ALREADY exists in production -- MetaBrief re-resolves the writer LLM\r\n 1250: (nodes/otr_meta_brief_image_prompt.py:2087-2096, :2158) with no audio ordering gate. The\r\n 1251: feature introduces no new interleaving hazard, and an inbound edge from the visual lane\r\n 1252: into the audio lane is a coupling not worth adding on an assumption. **Reopen trigger:**\r\n 1253: a live smoke that OOMs with an LLM and an audio model co-resident. The `done` output\r\n 1254: exists precisely so this edge is a one-link change if that happens.\r\n 1255: \r\n 1256: Still open -- implementation choices, not design forks:\r\n 1257: \r\n 1258: - **I1 -- where the must-fit / provider-effective helper lives** (4.3):\r\n 1259:   `_otr_model_loader` is the natural home. Requirement: fail-loud on overflow, never\r\n 1260:   truncate, and the SAME interface feeds preflight, invocation and receipt.\r\n 1261: - **I2 -- constrained generation on/off for P-A** (4.3): lm-format-enforcer binds the\r\n 1262:   schema at token level on the local HF lane and is the strongest defense against the\r\n 1263:   wrong-depth class, but it costs latency and has no Google branch. Codex measures and\r\n 1264:   decides; the typed-repair ladder is mandatory either way.\r\n 1265: - **I3 -- P-B batch size and output reservation** (4.4): DERIVE from the measured\r\n 1266:   maxima. The batching itself is not optional.\r\n 1267: \r\n 1268: ---\r\n 1269: \r\n 1270: END. Docs-only deliverable; no code, tests, prompts, registries, or\r\n 1271: workflows/otr_canonical.json were touched. Codex owns everything in section 8.\r\n 1272: Kibitz artifacts: kibitz-runs/2026-07-12-dynamic-story-visual/{r1,r2,r3}/\r\n 1273: (driver_anchor.md, codex.md, antigravity.md, judgment.md, final.md).\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
